      Q. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعْمَسَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>deposited
his ordure,</i> or <i>excrement, at once:</i> (K, TA:) or
<i>in a dry,</i> or <i>tough, state.</i> (TA.) The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> is augmentative. (Sgh, TA.)

